<title>USA: U.S. stock index futures cut gains slightly.</title>
<headline>U.S. stock index futures cut gains slightly.</headline>
<text>
<p>June 19 - U.S. stock index futures cut their gains slightly after strong Philly Fed data turned Sept bonds negative. Business activity index rose to 25.2 in June from 1.6 in May. New orders to 24.8 vs 8.6 in May and shipments index edged up to 12.4 from 12.1.</p>
